---

<section id="philosophy" data-section="philosophy" class="section">
  <span class="section-watermark" data-watermark="01" aria-hidden="true">01</span>
  <p class="label reveal">01 — philosophy</p>
  <h2 class="reveal">How I think.</h2>
  <div class="philosophy-list">
    <p class="philosophy-line reveal">
      <span class="prompt">&gt;</span> Stylishness isn't something you look at. It's how
      I say exactly what I feel.
    </p>
    <p class="philosophy-line reveal">
      <span class="prompt">&gt;</span> A limit is not a stop. It's a challenge.
    </p>
    <p class="philosophy-proof reveal">
      RunBox exists because a 4GB MacBook Air on macOS 11 couldn't run Docker. So
      instead of waiting for better hardware, I built around the limit.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .philosophy-list {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--space-4);
    margin-top: var(--space-4);
  }

  .philosophy-line {
    font-size: var(--text-header);
    line-height: 1.4;
  }

  .philosophy-line .prompt {
    font-family: var(--font-recursive);
    font-variation-settings: var(--vf-terminal);
    color: var(--color-phosphor);
    margin-right: var(--space-2);
  }

  .philosophy-proof {
    font-family: var(--font-recursive);
    font-variation-settings: var(--vf-quote);
    font-size: var(--text-terminal);
    color: var(--color-static);
    line-height: var(--leading-terminal);
    padding-left: calc(var(--space-2) + 1ch);
    border-left: 1px solid oklch(55% 0.02 295 / 0.3);
    margin-top: var(--space-2);
  }

  .philosophy-list .reveal:nth-child(1) { transition-delay: 0ms; }
  .philosophy-list .reveal:nth-child(2) { transition-delay: 80ms; }
  .philosophy-list .reveal:nth-child(3) { transition-delay: 160ms; }
</style>
